Package: dbiutils
Title: Lightweight Utilities for DBI Workflows
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Tony", family = "Chemit", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "tchemit@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: Provides small, driver-independent helpers for common database
    workflows built on top of the 'DBI' package. It supports executing queries
    as 'data.table' objects, safely managing short-lived connections supplied
    by application code, and reading SQL statements from UTF-8 files.
License: LGPL-2.1
URL: https://ultreia-io.github.io/dbiutils/,
    https://github.com/ultreia-io/dbiutils
BugReports: https://github.com/ultreia-io/dbiutils/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends:
    R (>= 4.0.0)
Imports:
    data.table,
    DBI
Suggests:
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    RSQLite,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
